- It's easy to think that
Europe was so successful

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:06.540
in taking over the world

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.990
because they had, like, better
ships or guns, or whatever.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.000
But when you actually
look at the whole story,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.400
you see that it was actually
just a perfect storm

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.030
of technology and timing
and ideology and religion,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.890
of a few key inventions.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.630
And what I wanna show you in this video

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.550
is that one of the biggest reasons

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.260
that Europe was able
to take over the world

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.200
is because of the invention
of the modern corporation,

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.420
a collection of people
who don't know each other

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.180
but who pool their money
together for the same goal:

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.180
extracting resources from far away places.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.480
So this is part two of "How
Europe Stole the World."

